Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,ПРЕДСТ,,0,0,0,,ФАНСАБ-ГРУППА АЗАЛИИ ПРЕДСТАВЛЯЕТ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 l 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,worked,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Worked on the series:\N Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, Zinger, Hazelnut
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,title,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(846,392)}How I became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,name,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(848,456)}queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.09,0:01:06.37,Default,li,0,0,0,,All characters are fictitious,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.37,0:01:08.54,Default,li,0,0,0,,and the events shown are fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:12.30,Default,li,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.37,0:01:19.82,Default,li,0,0,0,,My queen, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.75,0:01:31.82,Default,li,0,0,0,,-Congratulations, Your Majesty!\N-Congratulations, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.60,0:01:36.69,Default,li,0,0,0,,I'm going to become a father!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.46,0:01:42.54,Default,li,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.90,0:01:46.50,Default,is,0,0,0,,pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.83,0:02:09.89,Default,li,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.10,0:02:24.35,Default,li,0,0,0,,-Lord.\N-Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.47,0:02:26.08,Default,li,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.30,0:02:42.72,Default,li,0,0,0,,Why is the queen so upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.36,0:02:45.66,Default,li,0,0,0,,She's not upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.07,0:02:48.21,Default,li,0,0,0,,This is how she expresses her joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:50.00,Default,li,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.94,0:02:57.10,Default,is,0,0,0,,Is this a side effect of pregnancy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.64,0:03:03.08,Default,or,0,0,0,,This is more than a self-identification failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.08,0:03:05.98,Default,li,0,0,0,,My identity will disappear and my soul will disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.82,0:03:10.22,Default,whether,0,0,0,,Is this how my life will end?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.82,0:03:16.50,Default,li,0,0,0,,I told you that I am against marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.57,0:03:18.47,Default,or,0,0,0,,Even if I happened to be married,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.47,0:03:20.07,Default,li,0,0,0,,I didn’t want to have children.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.44,0:03:23.10,Default,li,0,0,0,,It’s hard for me to survive\N in this hostile world,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.10,0:03:24.31,Default,whether,0,0,0,,what kind of pregnancy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:26.44,Default,li,0,0,0,,As reckless as taking off your body armor
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:28.67,Default,li,0,0,0,,and dance the samba under fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.85,0:03:30.97,Default,li,0,0,0,,And that’s not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:33.94,Default,whether,0,0,0,,Pregnancy and childbirth shorten life expectancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:36.54,Default,li,0,0,0,,You give up your life so that your child can live.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.88,0:03:38.69,Default,li,0,0,0,,I must give up my life
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.69,0:03:40.62,Default,is it,0,0,0,,for the sake of a child I don’t even know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.66,0:03:46.85,Default,or,0,0,0,,Damn Mother Nature, grant someone else procreation!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:57.20,Default,li,0,0,0,,I don’t believe I’m pregnant!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:05.72,Default,li,0,0,0,,Pregnancy is wonderful
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.44,0:04:08.98,Default,li,0,0,0,,Wait, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.91,0:04:12.66,Default,li,0,0,0,,17 episode
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.53,0:04:19.32,Default,li,0,0,0,,You planted another body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.42,0:04:22.40,Default,li,0,0,0,,You thought I couldn’t recognize Ovol?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:27.13,Default,li,0,0,0,,I did this so that you would know
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.63,0:04:30.07,Default,or,0,0,0,,my true self, which I didn’t even suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.66,0:04:34.20,Default,li,0,0,0,,The Queen turned away from the Andonian Kims.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.63,0:04:38.17,Default,li,0,0,0,,The Andonian Kims have united with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:42.72,Default,li,0,0,0,,This is your chance to become queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.75,0:04:47.66,Default,li,0,0,0,,Don't try to control me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.19,0:04:55.90,Default,li,0,0,0,,How long will a bird tamed by man live,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.87,0:04:59.90,Default,if,0,0,0,,if he leaves the cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.94,0:05:07.44,Default,li,0,0,0,,There is news that the king wants to convey to the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:09.60,Default,or,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.97,0:05:11.62,Default,li,0,0,0,,Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.28,0:05:15.29,Default,is,0,0,0,,pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.73,0:05:41.58,Default,li,0,0,0,,This is a drum announcing a joyful event.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.15,0:06:18.31,Default,li,0,0,0,,Now that my pantry is empty,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.81,0:06:21.48,Default,or,0,0,0,,there is nothing to fill an empty heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.68,0:06:26.11,Default,li,0,0,0,,No delicacy will fill my stomach...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.39,0:06:31.05,Default,li,0,0,0,,No, my soul. How to fill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.85,0:06:34.20,Default,li,0,0,0,,I turned my back on my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.03,0:06:37.77,Default,li,0,0,0,,I am a loner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.97,0:06:42.14,Default,li,0,0,0,,Mr!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.66,0:06:43.80,Default,li,0,0,0,,Mr!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.28,0:06:47.51,Default,li,0,0,0,,-Mr!\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.51,0:06:49.37,Default,li,0,0,0,,Urgent news from the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.65,0:06:56.29,Default,li,0,0,0,,Something happened to the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:06:59.85,Default,li,0,0,0,,The Queen is pregnant!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:07.79,Default,or,0,0,0,,What is the reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.47,0:07:14.49,Default,li,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, instead of looking for a reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.49,0:07:18.87,Default,or,0,0,0,,maybe you can try to make her feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:22.01,Default,li,0,0,0,,Good idea. How to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.01,0:07:24.21,Default,li,0,0,0,,How to make a woman happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.35,0:07:30.61,Default,li,0,0,0,,How do you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.05,0:07:34.89,Default,li,0,0,0,,And who should I ask about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.03,0:07:41.22,Default,li,0,0,0,,So I
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.79,0:07:45.34,Default,li,0,0,0,,invited an expert to help solve your problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:09.29,Default,li,0,0,0,,Lately, this is the only question he has been thinking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.70,0:08:18.27,Default,li,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.27,0:08:20.34,Default,li,0,0,0,,She'll probably be just as angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.64,0:08:23.97,Default,li,0,0,0,,And then you will say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.64,0:08:28.71,Default,li,0,0,0,,"I watered my flower."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.41,0:08:33.35,Default,li,0,0,0,,If I do this, I doubt I will survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.37,0:08:35.11,Default,li,0,0,0,,So she is a girl with character.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.52,0:08:37.29,Default,or,0,0,0,,In that case
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.85,0:08:39.52,Default,is there an effective way?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.72,0:08:40.98,Default,or,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.66,0:08:47.90,Default,li,0,0,0,,You make such a stupid face.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:53.47,Default,li,0,0,0,,I hate myself for thinking the same way as him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.06,0:08:55.47,Default,li,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.10,0:08:57.91,Default,whether,0,0,0,,There is at least some benefit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.16,0:08:59.21,Default,or,0,0,0,,Cannot be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.21,0:09:02.91,Default,li,0,0,0,,I realized how stupid it is to look for the answer from someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.08,0:09:06.97,Default,li,0,0,0,,Only I know her better than everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.33,0:09:27.04,Default,li,0,0,0,,Why are you crying? It's me who wants to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.10,0:09:28.77,Default,li,0,0,0,,These are tears of happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.20,0:09:32.57,Default,li,0,0,0,,You can cry as much as you want today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.84,0:09:39.34,Default,li,0,0,0,,Okay. Cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.48,0:09:43.25,Default,li,0,0,0,,You can cry for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.79,0:09:47.21,Default,li,0,0,0,,Shed tears for my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.66,0:09:50.45,Default,or,0,0,0,,in which I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.03,0:09:56.13,Default,li,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.42,0:10:01.04,Default,li,0,0,0,,Stop shedding tears of happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.61,0:10:04.01,Default,li,0,0,0,,What else should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.01,0:10:08.14,Default,or,0,0,0,,You must personally notify the courtyard
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.14,0:10:10.07,Default,li,0,0,0,,and receive congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.20,0:10:14.15,Default,or,0,0,0,,I don’t want. I had a fight with my relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.84,0:10:16.34,Default,whether,0,0,0,,Argued or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.89,0:10:20.55,Default,or,0,0,0,,if you violate the established order, you will have to answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.73,0:10:23.68,Default,li,0,0,0,,So I hate pregnancy even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.29,0:10:28.05,Default,li,0,0,0,,The Queen Dowager has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.32,0:10:30.40,Default,li,0,0,0,,The Queen Mother is here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.66,0:10:32.87,Default,li,0,0,0,,They got ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:34.90,Default,or,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.02,0:10:53.29,Default,or,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:11:01.79,Default,li,0,0,0,,I should have notified you personally,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.53,0:11:06.46,Default,li,0,0,0,,but, as you can see, I can’t get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.51,0:11:10.04,Default,li,0,0,0,,What are my symptoms?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.30,0:11:16.07,Default,li,0,0,0,,She's dizzy due to morning sickness
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.07,0:11:18.15,Default,li,0,0,0,,and pain due to pregnancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.15,0:11:20.15,Default,li,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.48,0:11:23.84,Default,li,0,0,0,,So I came myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.21,0:11:28.41,Default,li,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.86,0:11:31.32,Default,or,0,0,0,,sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:32.63,Default,li,0,0,0,,Everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.86,0:11:35.87,Default,li,0,0,0,,It must be hard for you. Sit back comfortably.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.09,0:11:37.73,Default,li,0,0,0,,Okay, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:49.51,Default,li,0,0,0,,When I heard the news, I was delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.88,0:11:52.28,Default,li,0,0,0,,Even brought a talisman, although she refused them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.12,0:11:55.07,Default,li,0,0,0,,Wanted to make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.07,0:11:58.18,Default,whether,0,0,0,,that you will carry a healthy child.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.52,0:12:02.45,Default,li,0,0,0,,And it looks like a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.82,0:12:08.00,Default,li,0,0,0,,I am an atheist. I don't believe in talismans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.00,0:12:10.23,Default,li,0,0,0,,You will realize when you give birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.09,0:12:13.90,Default,li,0,0,0,,I want to believe in something I didn’t believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.66,0:12:16.77,Default,li,0,0,0,,You will fall into despair
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.77,0:12:21.17,Default,or,0,0,0,,and you want to make a wish on the stone that everyone is kicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:26.52,Default,li,0,0,0,,You don’t have to be afraid of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.78,0:12:30.91,Default,li,0,0,0,,But now you will be afraid of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.26,0:12:34.62,Default,li,0,0,0,,The loss of a child has a bad effect on the mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.68,0:12:38.63,Default,li,0,0,0,,I asked the doctor to prepare the medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.63,0:12:40.36,Default,or,0,0,0,,which will protect you from miscarriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:42.53,Default,li,0,0,0,,Take it strictly every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.06,0:12:45.09,Default,or,0,0,0,,If something happens to the child,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.09,0:12:47.33,Default,or,0,0,0,,you will be responsible for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.77,0:12:49.87,Default,li,0,0,0,,From now on, don’t behave rashly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.11,0:12:52.80,Default,li,0,0,0,,Be careful for the sake of the child.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.67,0:12:56.04,Default,li,0,0,0,,Both came to intimidate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.20,0:12:58.71,Default,li,0,0,0,,I'm really going to be sick now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.33,0:13:24.14,Default,li,0,0,0,,Thank you for your wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.16,0:13:41.31,Default,lee,0,0,0,,This is Prince Yeonpyeong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.99,0:13:46.09,Default,or,0,0,0,,Enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.01,0:13:57.91,Default,li,0,0,0,,You came because you were worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.91,0:14:01.07,Default,li,0,0,0,,I'm fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.30,0:14:04.61,Default,li,0,0,0,,but I can’t bring myself to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.61,0:14:06.88,Default,or,0,0,0,,congratulate the king and queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.02,0:14:10.89,Default,li,0,0,0,,I have my own path.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:15.92,Default,li,0,0,0,,I came to the palace to help His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.68,0:14:18.29,Default,li,0,0,0,,I thought it was the only way
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.32,0:14:21.82,Default,if,0,0,0,,to help him is to give him mental comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.27,0:14:25.56,Default,li,0,0,0,,But when I saw the queen, I realized that I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.74,0:14:32.54,Default,li,0,0,0,,This is your chance to become queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.81,0:14:45.95,Default,li,0,0,0,,Queen Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.81,0:14:50.32,Default,li,0,0,0,,To what do I owe this pleasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.23,0:15:01.59,Default,li,0,0,0,,What brings you here, chief concubine?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.33,0:15:08.33,Default,li,0,0,0,,You have teamed up with the Andonian Kims.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:13.07,Default,li,0,0,0,,-This is the desire of the clan.\N-Do not trade in the name of the clan
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.07,0:15:14.67,Default,or,0,0,0,,for the sake of a minor fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.25,0:15:18.25,Default,or,0,0,0,,Do you want to remain the right advisor?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.41,0:15:22.13,Default,or,0,0,0,,Make the right decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.13,0:15:25.45,Default,or,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I will gather members of our clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.45,0:15:27.69,Default,whether,0,0,0,,concerned about the future of Joseon,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.19,0:15:30.32,Default,li,0,0,0,,led by my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.70,0:15:40.67,Default,or,0,0,0,,My father sent all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.14,0:15:42.17,Default,or,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.61,0:15:46.07,Default,li,0,0,0,,Gifts for the baby you are carrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.54,0:15:48.02,Default,li,0,0,0,,And there is more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.34,0:15:49.91,Default,li,0,0,0,,There are also gifts in the corridor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.52,0:15:55.73,Default,li,0,0,0,,This puzzles me even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.36,0:15:59.69,Default,li,0,0,0,,It’s already dark, I’ll light the candles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.16,0:16:06.43,Default,is,0,0,0,,What good are these candles?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.87,0:16:08.56,Default,li,0,0,0,,From this moment on, my life
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:11.74,Default,or,0,0,0,,will become pitch black.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.13,0:16:38.93,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Left Advisor Kim Seok-keun
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.93,0:16:43.04,Default,zi,0,0,0,,They attacked the official again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.24,0:16:45.24,Default,zi,0,0,0,,They did not behead the leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.70,0:16:47.17,Default,zi,0,0,0,,We didn’t dare touch him,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.17,0:16:50.04,Default,zi,0,0,0,,because they were afraid that it would be regarded as treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.25,0:16:52.41,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Are these peasants so brave?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.17,0:16:56.08,Default,zi,0,0,0,,There is no reason to throw all your efforts into catching them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.08,0:16:57.29,Default,zi,0,0,0,,This worries me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.05,0:17:02.99,Default,zi,0,0,0,,By the way, did they find the code of Tonhak’s followers in the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.46,0:17:13.50,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Kim Soyeon
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.77,0:17:17.00,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Tonghak's followers were able to enter the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.00,0:17:18.83,Default,zi,0,0,0,,this is serious, you need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.83,0:17:22.48,Default,zi,0,0,0,,What if because we\N didn’t do anything, there will be more of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.15,0:17:27.65,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Just focus on your tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.45,0:17:38.58,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, from this day
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.42,0:17:40.59,Default,zi,0,0,0,,"Prenatal education"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.59,0:17:42.23,Default,zi,0,0,0,,you will begin prenatal training.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.64,0:17:50.56,Default,zi,0,0,0,,You cannot lie on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.77,0:17:52.70,Default,zi,0,0,0,,You cannot lean on your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.11,0:17:56.30,Default,zi,0,0,0,,You cannot raise your head when you are lying down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:17:57.30,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.19,0:18:14.46,Default,zi,0,0,0,,You can’t laugh, be surprised, or be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.73,0:18:16.70,Default,zi,0,0,0,,mourn, cry
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:19.79,Default,zi,0,0,0,,and you can’t talk a lot either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.80,0:18:29.51,Default,zi,0,0,0,,You need to give up such unusual food.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.78,0:18:34.18,Default,zi,0,0,0,,As if my body doesn’t belong to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.07,0:18:36.54,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Well, it's true, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.54,0:18:38.02,Default,zi,0,0,0,,But I just got used to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.81,0:18:41.26,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Why did everything go back to the original because of this pregnancy\N?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.49,0:18:43.62,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Especially you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.38,0:18:46.43,Default,zi,0,0,0,,I thought you stopped pestering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:50.89,Default,zi,0,0,0,,This is all for the sake of your baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.89,0:18:52.86,Default,zi,0,0,0,,For the child to survive,\NI would first have to survive myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:54.20,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Am I a machine for stamping children?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.20,0:18:55.44,Default,zi,0,0,0,,A living incubator, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.94,0:18:57.77,Default,zi,0,0,0,,By the way, I’m not the only one who has to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.83,0:18:58.90,Default,zi,0,0,0,,What is daddy doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.90,0:19:00.60,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Go to Cheoljong, tell him about the training.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.18,0:19:04.64,Default,zi,0,0,0,,In general, line 3 of chapter 1 says that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.64,0:19:08.07,Default,zi,0,0,0,,the father must also undergo prenatal education.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.07,0:19:10.29,Default,zi,0,0,0,,As soon as His Majesty finishes with his business,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:11.95,Default,zi,0,0,0,,you will study together...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.95,0:19:13.52,Default,zi,0,0,0,,My day started with pregnancy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.52,0:19:15.08,Default,zi,0,0,0,,and this will end the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.85,0:19:20.93,Default,zi,0,0,0,,My life is already lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:26.79,Default,zi,0,0,0,,No, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.06,0:19:30.60,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Impossible, Your Majesty. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.60,0:19:31.63,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Hon Young.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:35.28,Default,zi,0,0,0,,After that incident
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.98,0:19:38.45,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Kim Byunin and the queen did not see each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.75,0:19:41.75,Default,zi,0,0,0,,After the refusal, he should have found out that she was pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:44.58,Default,zi,0,0,0,,I’m sure he has no one to rely on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.88,0:19:48.42,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:19:58.47,Default,zi,0,0,0,,I hope you eat well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.00,0:20:00.09,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.97,0:20:05.60,Default,zi,0,0,0,,You need to sleep at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.90,0:20:09.64,Default,zi,0,0,0,,You look exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.29,0:20:25.96,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Stress is the cause of all diseases.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.96,0:20:27.73,Default,zi,0,0,0,,It will also be harmful for the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.89,0:20:31.00,Default,zee,0,0,0,,Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.39,0:20:33.63,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Just one spoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.54,0:20:39.74,Default,zi,0,0,0,,My pear wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.07,0:20:45.34,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Royal Chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.45,0:20:52.46,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Where is the pear wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.29,0:20:55.76,Default,zi,0,0,0,,It was spoiled, I threw it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.10,0:21:17.40,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Someone is in a great mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.78,0:21:20.14,Default,zi,0,0,0,,I'm still the same as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.38,0:21:28.11,Default,zi,0,0,0,,They said that they stopped smiling a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.29,0:21:29.69,Default,zi,0,0,0,,And I found the smile again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.39,0:21:35.39,Default,zi,0,0,0,,I lost my wine,\Nand you found my smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.32,0:21:39.97,Default,zi,0,0,0,,What a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.71,0:21:46.07,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Tell the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.51,0:21:47.78,Default,zi,0,0,0,,You’re having fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.13,0:21:51.87,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Avenge your suffering,\Nas soon as the opportunity arises.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.54,0:21:55.68,Default,zi,0,0,0,,You can’t shake me, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.81,0:22:00.22,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Let him vomit. Spit out my wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.22,0:22:01.58,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.92,0:22:03.53,Default,zi,0,0,0,,It’s better to discuss everything, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.62,0:22:05.12,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Discuss, yes now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.96,0:22:09.82,Default,zi,0,0,0,,My pear wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.77,0:22:14.04,Default,zi,0,0,0,,They drank all the wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.29,0:22:17.24,Default,zi,0,0,0,,-My Vintso!\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.74,0:22:22.98,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Give me the wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.04,0:22:28.04,Default,zi,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-My wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.04,0:22:31.04,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Why are you crying, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.76,0:22:43.27,Default,zi,0,0,0,,I was waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.27,0:22:46.44,Default,zi,0,0,0,,And you are cool, like a prince on a white horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.59,0:22:49.71,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Everything was forbidden to me, and you are riding a horse and having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.71,0:22:51.90,Default,zi,0,0,0,,You are very upset today, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.48,0:22:53.60,Default,zi,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.54,0:23:00.81,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Let's take a ride together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.18,0:23:04.11,Default,zi,0,0,0,,This is not possible, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.95,0:23:06.96,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Her Majesty is carrying a royal child.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.29,0:23:10.58,Default,zi,0,0,0,,You cannot ride with her, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.70,0:23:17.97,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.04,0:23:23.06,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, this is dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.21,0:23:25.87,Default,zi,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-You can’t!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.87,0:23:27.94,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.15,0:23:47.35,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.50,0:23:50.29,Default,zi,0,0,0,,I always wanted to give you something
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.29,0:23:52.47,Default,zi,0,0,0,,what do you love and want most.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.00,0:23:55.54,Default,zi,0,0,0,,What cannot be found in the palace, only outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.54,0:23:58.24,Default,zi,0,0,0,,-Entertainment?\N-I'm talking about freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.28,0:24:03.37,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Don’t like it, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.54,0:24:09.75,Default,zi,0,0,0,,So I would say, just a walk. \NWhy so much pomp?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.29,0:24:13.22,Default,zi,0,0,0,,We came to the royal estate for a breath of fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.08,0:24:15.58,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Let's go back if you don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.19,0:24:20.53,Default,zi,0,0,0,,A royal estate is like a summer house, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.12,0:24:24.56,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Nice. It's like the rich man is flirting with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.23,0:24:27.17,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Since we're here, let's take a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.83,0:24:30.56,Default,zi,0,0,0,,I knew you would like it, my queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.56,0:24:32.44,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.18,0:24:36.01,Default,zi,0,0,0,,It’s great to be a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.07,0:24:39.64,Default,zi,0,0,0,,And a luxurious estate and a garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.92,0:24:43.45,Default,zi,0,0,0,,I've been wondering all night why you're so angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.84,0:24:46.72,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Usually for the women of the palace\N pregnancy is a blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.72,0:24:50.08,Default,zi,0,0,0,,But why was the queen so upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.76,0:24:53.50,Default,zi,0,0,0,,And? Do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.89,0:24:57.50,Default,zi,0,0,0,,No. No matter how much I thought, I still didn’t understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.47,0:25:02.06,Default,zi,0,0,0,,I don’t understand, so I decided to accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.36,0:25:07.60,Default,zi,0,0,0,,What grace is for others may not be such for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.98,0:25:11.87,Default,zi,0,0,0,,You are such a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.31,0:25:16.61,Default,zi,0,0,0,,It seems that the queen’s dictionary is really useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.13,0:25:38.56,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this? It's awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.90,0:25:44.07,Default,zi,0,0,0,,My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.49,0:25:54.96,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Is that “rrr”?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.53,0:25:58.73,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Rrrrr!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.32,0:26:08.63,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Since I'm writing the queen's dictionary,\NI'm interested in something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.83,0:26:11.60,Default,zi,0,0,0,,What does “all in” mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.33,0:26:13.78,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Did I say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.78,0:26:16.40,Default,zi,0,0,0,,This is the word you shouted while gambling on the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.72,0:26:20.95,Default,zi,0,0,0,,All-in -
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.04,0:26:24.45,Default,zi,0,0,0,,a very stupid act when you are all
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.88,0:26:27.11,Default,zi,0,0,0,,you put fragile eggs in one basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.81,0:26:31.43,Default,zi,0,0,0,,-Eggs?\N-I did this stupid thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.00,0:26:35.50,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Damn, at the time when you need to run,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.65,0:26:37.77,Default,zi,0,0,0,,I tripped over a pregnancy stone and fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.89,0:26:40.50,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, my queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.54,0:26:46.07,Default,zi,0,0,0,,I will definitely get rid of all the rottenness of Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.48,0:26:49.18,Default,zi,0,0,0,,For our baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.37,0:26:52.54,Default,zi,0,0,0,,who will inherit the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.95,0:26:56.08,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.72,0:27:00.85,Default,zi,0,0,0,,If this child becomes king\N and inherits the country...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.08,0:27:05.38,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Can I gain absolute power?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.96,0:27:09.67,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Sungwon World
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.67,0:27:13.00,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Soyeon's World
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.63,0:27:15.63,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Why didn’t I think of this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.17,0:27:18.44,Default,zi,0,0,0,,-What are you talking about?\N-My baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.44,0:27:19.63,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.87,0:27:23.95,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Everything under these skies -
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.64,0:27:26.87,Default,zi,0,0,0,,all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.98,0:27:29.99,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Let's go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.99,0:27:32.34,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Now I will begin the real prenatal training.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.79,0:27:33.99,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Present?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.99,0:27:35.99,Default,zi,0,0,0,,I need to teach him how to win in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.79,0:27:39.76,Default,zi,0,0,0,,This baby will have to live in a hostile palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.53,0:27:41.65,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Let's go, let's start already.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.65,0:27:43.73,Default,zi,0,0,0,,We just arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.56,0:27:47.77,Default,zi,0,0,0,,Even if I write 100 volumes of the dictionary,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.13,0:27:51.56,Default,zi,0,0,0,,will the day come when I can understand her?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.56,0:27:54.78,Default,zi,0,0,0,,-Wait! Wait for me.\N-Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.02,0:28:00.52,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Pregnancy Diary
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.31,0:28:17.37,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.67,0:28:20.48,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,to survive in the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.48,0:28:23.18,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,you must gather reliable people around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.78,0:28:30.12,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.52,0:28:34.02,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,They really are the best warriors in Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.39,0:28:35.42,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.52,0:28:38.63,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,you must keep your enemies close.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.19,0:28:40.76,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Say, a thousand warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.96,0:28:43.43,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,With such military power
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.07,0:28:46.67,Default,shooting range 3,0,0,0,,are you going to capture Seongjongjong Hall or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.00,0:28:48.47,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Are you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.74,0:28:52.98,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,I think you’re the only one afraid here,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.98,0:28:55.08,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,times they prepared a thousand warriors for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.58,0:28:57.41,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Halve the number of warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.41,0:28:59.41,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,The rest are in the royal guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.05,0:29:03.69,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Baby, you must have your own secret treasury.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.39,0:29:07.52,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,These coins have just been minted.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.52,0:29:09.89,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,-How many is there?\N-Million.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.23,0:29:14.73,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Is this your investment in politics?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.56,0:29:17.37,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,He who has the money has the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.70,0:29:22.04,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,And finally, baby, the most important lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.70,0:29:25.81,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Get rid of everyone who is not on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.21,0:29:28.41,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Life is a game, and the world is a jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.41,0:29:31.68,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,You will be eaten if you do not eat the others first. This is a killer party!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.31,0:29:34.25,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Of course, you will try to establish peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.78,0:29:36.69,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,But if there is no hope,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.69,0:29:39.62,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,you must win at all costs, my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.03,0:29:45.73,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,I'm so glad that Her Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.86,0:29:47.76,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,coped with my excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.96,0:29:50.97,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,He wasn’t born yet, and you already want to tell him so many things?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.77,0:29:53.67,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,He will listen while he sits in his stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.94,0:29:56.27,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,And it will stop as soon as it is born.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.81,0:30:01.11,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,It’s time for you to go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.61,0:30:04.85,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,I don’t have time to sleep: there’s so much to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.71,0:30:07.42,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Life is like a treadmill,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.42,0:30:10.49,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,you only have to stop for a second and you will immediately fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.92,0:30:13.82,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Even pregnancy won’t stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.82,0:30:17.39,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Or it will stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.60,0:30:23.17,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,In my soul I have a motor, but in reality I have pedals.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.01,0:30:39.05,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.48,0:30:40.72,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,It must have been hard for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.68,0:30:42.68,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.56,0:30:52.90,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,You have completed the tactics tutorial.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.00,0:30:55.23,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,These people have never held weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.50,0:30:57.47,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,so they will be difficult to train.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.20,0:30:59.33,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,But the tutorial will help.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.17,0:31:04.21,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.65,0:31:17.42,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,I didn’t know
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.39,0:31:19.89,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,that the number of followers has grown so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.66,0:31:23.03,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,In other words, many people
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.03,0:31:24.96,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,found ourselves in a difficult situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.49,0:31:28.80,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Lately they have attracted a variety of classes:
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.23,0:31:31.07,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,from ruined nobles to ploughmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.40,0:31:33.20,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Perhaps, as the queen said,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.84,0:31:36.81,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,is our solution to abolish the class division?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.37,0:31:39.37,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,We must beware
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.21,0:31:41.64,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,fundamental changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.95,0:31:44.71,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Of course, this is still a long way off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.65,0:31:47.62,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,I probably won’t be able to do this, but,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.32,0:31:51.65,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,maybe my child can.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.96,0:32:02.56,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, His Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.87,0:32:05.10,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Don’t wake her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.44,0:32:16.35,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,She's just like a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.15,0:32:28.26,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Pregnancy log
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.29,0:32:30.43,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,You must keep your enemies close.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.86,0:32:36.30,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Baby, you must have your own secret treasury.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.04,0:32:42.54,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Life is a game, and the world is a jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.54,0:32:44.57,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,You will be eaten if you do not eat the others first. This is a killer party!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.24,0:32:46.27,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,"Party"?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.68,0:32:48.68,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Evening...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.35,0:32:53.45,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,I don’t understand what “Inca” means.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.05,0:32:55.35,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Party.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.26,0:33:03.13,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Since everything is fine with the queen, you were not hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.53,0:33:07.13,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,I knew: the talisman that I gave worked as it should.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.50,0:33:09.70,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.70,0:33:10.73,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,I guess
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.40,0:33:14.40,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,did you spread rumors as I told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.44,0:33:16.51,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Cannot be.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.44,0:33:19.37,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,You've been gossiping since the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.08,0:33:21.91,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Have you at least gone to wash your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.91,0:33:25.08,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,You should hear this. I'm sure you'll fall asleep right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.02,0:33:28.78,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,You know, the queen...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.12,0:33:34.19,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.19,0:33:37.93,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,What? Did His Majesty and the Queen pretend to sleep together?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.16,0:33:42.46,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,His Majesty and the Queen pretended to sleep together.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.97,0:33:52.34,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,I heard they didn’t actually sleep together.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.34,0:33:54.31,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,They just spent the night in the same room.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.58,0:34:00.32,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,What? Then who is her child?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.18,0:34:03.22,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Who is her child from then?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.22,0:34:05.45,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,-It can’t be.\N-I heard they were pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.30,0:34:23.64,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,You must have heard the rumors circulating around the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.64,0:34:26.01,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Rumors are always one step behind the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.31,0:34:28.11,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,This is an old story.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.11,0:34:31.51,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Rumors in the palace\N should not be taken lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.51,0:34:34.72,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,They can use them to depose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.72,0:34:36.62,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Exactly, their goal is my deposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.95,0:34:38.72,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,They play dirty and petty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.72,0:34:40.46,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,I won't let them throw me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.99,0:34:42.32,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N- Hong Young.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.26,0:34:48.46,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Why do you need a hairpin?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.75,0:35:15.39,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,What kind of defiant pose is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.39,0:35:16.99,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,We need to refute the rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.49,0:35:19.69,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,-Just look.\N-Right in front of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.69,0:35:21.23,Default,shooting 3,0,0,0,,-How awkward.\N-I can’t watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.43,0:35:25.53,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,In that case.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.67,0:35:30.67,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,This is not enough to quell the rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.81,0:35:33.18,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Let's try.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.18,0:35:35.08,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Isn’t it too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.94,0:35:37.45,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,But I haven’t shown everything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.45,0:35:47.52,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Insufficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.13,0:35:52.99,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Go ahead, continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.99,0:35:56.90,Default,shooting range 3,0,0,0,,If I continue, we will already need a tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.83,0:35:59.37,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Is this what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.00,0:36:01.34,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,I didn’t say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.34,0:36:03.14,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,We need to spur their imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.47,0:36:06.17,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Then for the same purpose
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.38,0:36:09.21,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,I will visit Daejojeon today.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.39,0:36:20.72,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,I have no choice, since I can be deposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.72,0:36:21.72,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Then
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.02,0:36:24.73,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.37,0:36:38.91,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,-Gone?\N-They are so slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.91,0:36:40.71,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Still looking at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.71,0:36:42.98,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Then you leave me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.23,0:37:07.04,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, the main concubine has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.68,0:37:16.28,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Did you arrange this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.52,0:37:23.89,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,-What are you talking about?\N-I'm talking about rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.52,0:37:27.79,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.76,0:37:31.99,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,I remembered what you told me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.76,0:37:36.36,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,You said that their nights together were just staged.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.27,0:37:41.47,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Therefore, the queen’s pregnancy will not be celebrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.94,0:37:43.77,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Your words
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.07,0:37:46.74,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,became an arrow and hit the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.94,0:37:48.61,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Please stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.61,0:37:50.88,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,I don’t control this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.11,0:37:53.85,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Once people start gossiping,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.85,0:37:55.95,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,and they can’t stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.19,0:38:01.42,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,And it’s too late for you to relieve yourself of responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.26,0:38:08.03,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,While you are here, you cannot be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.73,0:38:13.87,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Your existence will serve as support for the reputation of our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.57,0:38:17.84,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,It is better to be the initiator than to be used.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.61,0:38:22.88,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,This is scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.91,0:38:25.08,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.62,0:38:31.62,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,But you're not alone, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.93,0:38:44.07,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,I'm turning into someone like you -
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.83,0:38:46.03,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,that's what's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.77,0:38:50.87,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Do you know why the family follows your instructions?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.51,0:38:54.11,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Because you are an innocent victim,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.11,0:38:55.94,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,suffering from the loss of a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.64,0:38:58.68,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,But what if you are a soulless mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.68,0:39:00.92,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,sacrificed her son to survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.45,0:39:03.92,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,And moreover, what if you are a stupid woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.92,0:39:05.22,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,relying on shaman
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.22,0:39:07.46,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,regarding the future of our kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.16,0:39:10.13,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Will you remain in charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.76,0:39:14.66,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,I will write down everything I heard and saw here,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.66,0:39:16.66,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,so everyone in Joseon will know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.80,0:39:22.37,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,Words do not have such power.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.37,0:39:25.41,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,You will still know their strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.88,0:39:30.15,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,You once told me\N that you don't want to be sorry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.65,0:39:32.05,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,You are not worthy
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.05,0:39:34.42,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,regret the death of the late king.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.78,0:39:37.02,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,You should regret that you trampled on his dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.22,0:39:40.92,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,You, as his mother, should be sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.42,0:39:42.72,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,that destroyed my son’s dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.32,0:39:45.63,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,The late king probably really wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.39,0:39:48.33,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,come out of your shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.33,0:39:49.33,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.47,0:39:53.17,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,You know nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.97,0:39:57.01,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,How dare you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.01,0:39:58.51,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,This is the truth, known to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.67,0:40:01.78,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,And I'm sure you know this too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.48,0:40:06.45,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,I will not allow you to destroy His Majesty's dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.29,0:40:11.42,Default,tier 3,0,0,0,,This girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.17,0:40:25.63,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,I’ll go to the Daejojon hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.93,0:40:27.00,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.31,0:40:42.65,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,They say that dreams counteract rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.95,0:40:45.15,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,Rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.45,0:40:47.02,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,I didn’t tell anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.02,0:40:49.99,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,after all, a night with the king is an intimate matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.49,0:40:54.80,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,but if you find out, you will be very surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.90,0:40:58.13,Default,Spillie4,0,0,0,,In bed...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.86,0:41:25.13,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.03,0:41:27.80,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,You can’t tell me about hot nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.80,0:41:29.60,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,It’s a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.80,0:41:33.80,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,The king is not at all what he seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.34,0:41:37.54,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,His endurance will go down in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.61,0:41:44.31,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,So it was because of me that it ended up in the textbooks?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.91,0:41:48.78,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,Who spreads such false gossip?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.78,0:41:52.65,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Only the royal concubine Cho is capable of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.66,0:42:02.96,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.00,0:42:09.87,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,What? Now why did you come to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.35,0:42:18.81,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.69,0:42:25.45,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,We are sure that you are with the king
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.95,0:42:28.52,Default,Silk4,0,0,0,,can you fight them and win?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.89,0:42:32.39,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,This is my fight too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.89,0:42:34.93,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,And I also need a victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.20,0:42:46.65,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,Then you need to practice archery.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.21,0:42:50.75,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,With your current skills you will only be a burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.15,0:42:56.85,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Then can you teach me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.45,0:43:00.52,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,I have
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.29,0:43:05.16,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,no time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.90,0:43:11.43,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, concubine Cho is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.70,0:43:13.87,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Let him come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.05,0:43:29.05,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.35,0:43:30.35,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.35,0:43:32.02,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,You must fulfill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.62,0:43:35.49,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,And what kind of request?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.43,0:43:40.76,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Let me leave the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.07,0:43:46.43,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.87,0:43:50.41,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,I cannot find myself in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.04,0:43:53.04,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,Please drive me out of the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.61,0:43:55.64,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,so that I can live my own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.71,0:43:58.91,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,I can’t allow this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.35,0:44:02.28,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,You know what it’s like to live as an exiled royal concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.28,0:44:04.52,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,I don’t care what they say about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.52,0:44:08.46,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,I won’t be bound by this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.39,0:44:14.13,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,This is my last request,\Nplease satisfy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.70,0:44:23.07,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,I do not give my permission. I can't give it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.97,0:44:26.21,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,We valued each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.24,0:44:29.48,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,but there is no more love for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.14,0:44:31.55,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,In the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.41,0:44:34.08,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,I'm in captivity
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.15,0:44:37.75,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,under the name of the royal concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.43,0:45:23.06,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Your Majesty. All officials are assembled.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.43,0:45:31.04,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,The reason I had to gather you,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.71,0:45:36.31,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,that I have an important statement to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.05,0:45:46.15,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,From now on
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.89,0:45:49.89,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Cho Hwajin, royal consort,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.56,0:45:56.23,Default,Silk4,0,0,0,,loses the status of a royal concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.71,0:46:06.24,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,We must stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.38,0:46:11.78,Default,Silk4,0,0,0,,The royal concubine is no longer one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.29,0:46:20.79,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, be healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.06,0:46:25.93,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,I will pray for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.21,0:46:46.38,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.42,0:46:56.49,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,Please don’t call me that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.49,0:46:57.89,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,This is an error.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.06,0:47:00.46,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,The king should not do this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.46,0:47:02.23,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,I asked him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.13,0:47:06.93,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,-Why?\N-It’s better for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.84,0:47:11.24,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,While I’m in the palace, I’ll disturb the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.71,0:47:13.84,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,without wanting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.84,0:47:15.78,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,I'll make sure this doesn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.51,0:47:18.15,Default,Silk4,0,0,0,,It’s not too late to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.15,0:47:19.88,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,I'll go tell the king...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.85,0:47:23.99,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,I don’t believe myself anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.09,0:47:29.29,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,If I stay here any longer, I will completely lose myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.99,0:47:34.53,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,I pretended I didn’t know
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.76,0:47:38.00,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,about your feelings for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.67,0:47:44.37,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,-Your Highness.\N-I used you for my own purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.87,0:47:48.28,Default,Spillie4,0,0,0,,When I longed for a king,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.11,0:47:51.98,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,emptiness because he didn’t miss me,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.08,0:47:55.08,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,I filled it out with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.45,0:47:56.62,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.52,0:48:01.96,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,willingly allowed you to use me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.39,0:48:05.19,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,Only this I could do
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.33,0:48:08.60,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.63,0:48:11.17,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.57,0:48:13.70,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.97,0:48:16.50,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.51,0:48:19.31,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,It’s time for you to stop
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.67,0:48:23.01,Default,Silk4,0,0,0,,hurt yourself with love for the wrong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.26,0:48:45.67,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,So that’s what she meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.17,0:48:53.94,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,Cool woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.31,0:48:58.91,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Is Cheoljong okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.78,0:49:02.58,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,I'm sure not.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.67,0:49:27.21,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,Fight me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.48,0:49:28.78,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,I'm not in the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.94,0:49:29.98,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,In childhood
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.21,0:49:33.41,Default,Silk4,0,0,0,,on Ganghwado we often played the same game.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.88,0:49:38.59,Default,Spillikins4,0,0,0,,In which the one who first steps on the shadow of another will win.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.35,0:49:40.79,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,The one who does not want to play,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.79,0:49:44.33,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,loses immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.12,0:50:10.52,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.22,0:50:14.66,Default,Silk4,0,0,0,,As a child, I always won.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.93,0:50:20.86,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,I remember, then I always won.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.23,0:50:28.34,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,I should have been stricter with our hierarchy earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.64,0:50:31.64,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Hierarchy has nothing to do with it, you just couldn’t win.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.61,0:50:44.69,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Concubine Cho was worried about you until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.85,0:50:47.22,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,You don’t even understand how valuable this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.22,0:50:48.36,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,As I understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.16,0:50:50.59,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,That’s why I suffer so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.20,0:51:03.57,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,You should suffer more.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.44,0:51:05.51,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,This is the best,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.41,0:51:09.48,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,what can you do for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.45,0:51:20.09,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,How much longer do I have to suffer\N from loneliness and worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.59,0:51:21.92,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,How many more?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.96,0:51:39.30,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Is my Cheoljung drinking somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.83,0:51:42.07,Default,Silk4,0,0,0,,It would be better if I drank with him, if not for pregnancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.11,0:51:51.18,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,Pregnancy is not only about bearing a child, but also about becoming one?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.35,0:51:54.32,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,Why so drowsy all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.03,0:52:11.47,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,I’ll go to the Dongmyeongjong hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.03,0:52:14.20,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Be careful, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.77,0:52:16.40,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,Dangerous rumor,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.40,0:52:19.07,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,if they find out that he came from you...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.94,0:52:22.91,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Until the Dowager Queen found out,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.41,0:52:25.31,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,I have to tell her myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.21,0:52:28.35,Default,Silk4,0,0,0,,-But..\N-Don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.08,0:52:32.09,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,They can’t even imagine,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.09,0:52:33.89,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,that I will share a rumor that I myself started.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.86,0:52:40.33,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Appeared without an invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.69,0:52:42.70,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,I suppose I’ll ask for a favor again.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.70,0:52:45.00,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,I have heard amazing rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.00,0:52:48.14,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,I was afraid that you might fall ill from such news.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.54,0:52:50.84,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,So I came right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.84,0:52:52.21,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.48,0:52:58.45,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,Why so much effort?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.45,0:53:02.38,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,If you knew what we were talking about, you wouldn’t talk like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.32,0:53:04.75,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,Even curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.09,0:53:08.49,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,What kind of rumor is that you rushed like mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.39,0:53:12.26,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,He's too good to miss,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.56,0:53:16.03,Default,Spill4,0,0,0,,how your face will change when you hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.30,0:53:20.40,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,It’s unlikely that because of rumors my face will change like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.40,0:53:22.87,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,how you long to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.14,0:53:29.81,Default,Spill4,0,0,0,,The queen’s child is not the king’s.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.18,0:53:34.78,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,It is from Kim Byungin.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.92,0:53:40.19,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,You cared so much about your kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.45,0:53:44.86,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,Now it will go down in history that the Andonian Kim clan
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.86,0:53:47.29,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,stained the royal blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.64,0:54:01.78,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.88,0:54:05.05,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Now everything has become even more interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.99,0:54:16.79,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,Have you heard what they are talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.16,0:54:19.29,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,Yes, I heard. Unfounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.66,0:54:22.50,Default,Spill4,0,0,0,,The king and queen slept together
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.20,0:54:26.97,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,as expected. \NWhy did you start talking about this so late?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.97,0:54:28.34,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,That’s not what I’m talking about at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.60,0:54:30.90,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,They say the child is not the king’s.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.24,0:54:32.67,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,Hush, you'll bring trouble on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.28,0:54:45.92,Default,Silk4,0,0,0,,The whole yard is laughing at our clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.69,0:54:50.32,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,Connection between the queen and the minister of war, close relatives?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.09,0:54:53.33,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,I had high hopes for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.19,0:54:55.63,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.13,0:54:58.70,Default,Spiky4,0,0,0,,After the deposition of Concubine Cho,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.70,0:55:00.93,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,thought I was finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.93,0:55:04.40,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,But after the rumors about the queen,\NI feel like I won.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.27,0:55:10.91,Default,Spikyulka4,0,0,0,,The child is not of royal blood, but a well-fed one.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.53,0:55:34.57,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,My family is more important than my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.74,0:55:38.11,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,That’s why I live for my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.44,0:55:41.44,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,What do you live for?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.81,0:55:44.24,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,For the same reason as you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.05,0:55:47.08,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Is it so?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.48,0:55:51.39,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,If so, are you ready to do anything for the sake of your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.35,0:55:53.39,Default,Spilyk4,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.35,0:55:57.49,Default,Spillik4,0,0,0,,Then first bring me the queen's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.39,0:55:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.40,0:56:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.90,0:56:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen destroyed the reputation of our family, which we have accumulated for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.80,0:56:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.41,0:56:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know what made you angry,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.74,0:56:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but please have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.21,0:56:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the palace is gossiping
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.11,0:56:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,that the king and queen did not sleep together.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.85,0:56:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they say that the child is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.45,0:56:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.49,0:56:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.02,0:56:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What everyone believes becomes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.89,0:56:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as morning comes, people will spread this rumor
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.80,0:56:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and the queen will become a sinner,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.13,0:56:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,who became pregnant by someone else
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.77,0:56:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and lied that the child was from the king, thereby disgracing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.97,0:56:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The rumors appeared due to my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.01,0:56:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I will accept my punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.91,0:56:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A rumor can harm a man,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.31,0:56:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but he will kill a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.31,0:56:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,To save the honor of our family,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.08,0:56:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,need a queen's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.02,0:56:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If you bring me her head yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.29,0:57:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not punish you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.42,0:57:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.72,0:57:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Better punish me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.89,0:57:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He said that you live for your family,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.26,0:57:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but all just for the sake of the queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.93,0:57:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll entrust this to someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.50,0:57:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Is there anyone outside?\N-I will immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.37,0:57:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I will return your regency.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.61,0:57:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your idea is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.88,0:58:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,In a book with the queen's name
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.85,0:58:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw the code of the Tonhak followers written by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.19,0:58:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This dangerous idea has tainted you and the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.73,0:58:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They want to rebuild the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.07,0:58:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What will happen if the aristocrats sense danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.57,0:58:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They will try to keep everything as it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.94,0:58:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,even if it means taking people’s lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.48,0:58:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The massacre of Tonhak's followers will begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.31,0:58:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why did you come to me and not follow them?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.62,0:58:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it will harm the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.66,0:58:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kim Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.30,0:58:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,aimed at Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.97,0:58:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Spreading rumors that her child is from me,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.64,0:59:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,they want to kill her to preserve their honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.24,0:59:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,With this they want to attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.75,0:59:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'll stop them.\N-You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.08,0:59:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you save her now,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.79,0:59:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,her own family started the rumor,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.86,0:59:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,she will be forced to live with a bad reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.03,0:59:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only her, the child faces the same fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.37,0:59:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you understand that the officials who threaten your position will not leave her alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.95,0:59:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Only you can save Her Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.68,0:59:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.05,0:59:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I save her?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.45,0:59:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush the uprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.26,0:59:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Own
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.86,0:59:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,punish the followers of Tonhak.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.40,1:00:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Slander against the woman of the king who went to war,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.90,1:00:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to protect the country, it is inappropriate, this will dispel rumors.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.67,1:00:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you prove your innocence by killing Tonhak's followers,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.41,1:00:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the cipher found in the book\N will no longer be a threat to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.08,1:00:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.18,1:00:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,the only way to save
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.12,1:00:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,the queen and your child.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.53,1:00:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No time to think.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.30,1:00:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,In the morning, rumors will destroy the queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.10,1:00:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No way
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.77,1:00:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t let her suffer alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.14,1:01:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.48,1:01:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.38,1:01:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So it’s inconvenient, why don’t you go to bed?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.38,1:01:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to console you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.75,1:01:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was deep in thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.12,1:01:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So I want to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.36,1:01:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I will console you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.20,1:01:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You are my consolation.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.10,1:02:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sangnam uprising put the country in danger,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.13,1:02:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.91,1:02:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I leave, I ask you to get involved in politics.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.81,1:02:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,AND
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.01,1:03:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,take care of the queen and our child.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.28,1:03:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll do a good job with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.52,1:03:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt good without politics.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.76,1:03:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But what can you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.26,1:03:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about the queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.96,1:03:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of the one whose husband went
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.00,1:03:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to war, risking my life, is my duty.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.24,1:03:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Counting on you
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.14,1:03:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and I’ll go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.04,1:03:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.28,1:03:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun has already risen.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.91,1:04:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.55,1:04:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it’s me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.99,1:04:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.46,1:04:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true that you yourself are going to suppress the uprising?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.37,1:04:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.50,1:04:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.00,1:04:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You supported them, now are you going to kill them?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.71,1:04:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kim Byonin found a code hidden in the queen's book.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.88,1:04:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don’t do this, millions will suffer.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.45,1:04:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.75,1:04:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.85,1:04:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t it enough to have me hostage?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.32,1:04:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.76,1:04:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you think that the queen herself
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.30,1:04:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,gave the book to Kim Byungin?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.80,1:04:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.27,1:05:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is evidence that she is an enemy,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.14,1:05:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,you will personally behead her.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.00,1:05:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She should be beheaded, not other people.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.34,1:05:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen is definitely not our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.78,1:05:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She turned her back on everyone just to be on my side.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.95,1:05:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don’t leave right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.35,1:05:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,the queen will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.99,1:05:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down. This is not the time to quarrel with each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.19,1:05:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You said I need to suffer more.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.06,1:05:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.83,1:05:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.24,1:05:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.51,1:05:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,in danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.71,1:05:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If I try to survive,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.65,1:05:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone around me will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.97,1:06:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I saw him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.61,1:06:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Was this a dream?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.51,1:06:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi, Hong Young.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.09,1:06:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to Daejojon. I missed the king.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.56,1:06:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, Your Majesty.\N-Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.36,1:06:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty is leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.83,1:06:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving? Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.38,1:06:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.33,1:07:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.58,1:07:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.82,1:07:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.59,1:07:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.37,1:07:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the right road?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.74,1:07:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t think this road is for people.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.51,1:07:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the shortest path.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.10,1:08:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.67,1:08:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're late.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.21,1:08:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were going to do it anyway, don’t hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.45,1:08:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you get off the horse yourself or help?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.10,1:08:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There is nowhere to retreat.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.97,1:08:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to try.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.00,1:08:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.24,1:09:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle it alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.24,1:09:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything will be fine if I get rid of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.16,1:09:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How I became a queen
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.33,1:09:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.60,1:10:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.35,1:10:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This child eats so much.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.89,1:10:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Say: "Daddy, come back soon."{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.49,1:10:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think he kicked.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.33,1:10:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your Majesty, King...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.86,1:10:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now the owner of this place will change.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.93,1:10:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's the point,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.80,1:10:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}if you are not there?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.07,1:10:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You said you were innocent.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.34,1:10:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Being on the side of the weak is also a crime.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.97,1:10:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Benin. How far are you going to go?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.24,1:10:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The most important thing is to be born healthy.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.48,1:10:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will kill the queen,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.41,1:10:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}who teamed up with you to kill the king.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.74,0:16:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,


